@startuml
' Architecture Spec 3.8.1, 6.1, 7.3~7.4; Product UC-4~UC-6, BR-6~BR-11
title Combat Map Runtime State

[*] --> PreparedInactive : map preparation committed
state PreparedInactive
state Active {
  [*] --> Visible
  Visible --> Visible : MoveToken / ChangeDoor\nrefresh visibility
  Visible --> Visible : fail-closed projection\non visibility error
}
PreparedInactive --> Active : ActivateCombatMap\nspawn valid + atomic commit
PreparedInactive --> PreparedInactive : activation rejected\nversion/owner/spawn guard
Active --> PreparedInactive : activate another map\nnew activation succeeds
Active --> [*] : map deactivated
@enduml
